codex
`bp con` now prefers an existing local session, switches clients when already inside tmux, and otherwise selects mosh (with SSH fallback) from `~/.config/bp/config`. The installer and four release targets are in place; next I’m building the requested light, dependency-free product page and tightening user-facing documentation.
